# Zimone, Paradox Sculptor: "{G}{U}, {T}: Double the number of each kind of counter on up to two target creatures and/or artifacts you
# control." On turn 1 her combat trigger puts one +1/+1 counter on herself, and Bot1 casts an Everflowing Chalice kicked once on turn 3 for one
# charge counter. Activating her (Mox Emerald and Mox Sapphire for {G}{U}) with her and the Chalice as the two targets doubles both
# counts to two: a creature and an artifact, two different kinds. Then combat begins and the trigger adds a third counter to Zimone only.
# Bot2's Ornithopter is no legal target for either ability.

